      "cr": 0.125,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Resident T.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 2 on the docket → CR 1/8 as artisan (skilled crafters and maintainers, essential for faction operations); a thick leather apron (AC 12), hit points 2d6 + 2. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>The Crafters</strong> — Equipment maintenance, construction, repairs, supply management. Leader: Forgemaster Ironspore. Skilled artisans who maintain equipment, repair the Vigilance, and craft what the faction needs. Practical problem-solvers.</p><p><strong>On the docket:</strong> Ship engineer, level 2 (a T-pun name).</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Equipment</strong> — Workshop tools, Repair materials, Salvage equipment (the weapon items)</li><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Ship repair, Weapon maintenance, Construction (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Artisan</strong> — classDefinitions.artisan: Crafting Expertise (L1); Jury-Rig (L2)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — active: Working overtime on ship repairs</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      },
